","The relationship used to estimate the flilacity limits of mixtures from the data for individual fluids is known as the **Hückley-Hückbach-Hückbach (HHH) equation**, also known as the **Hückbach equation**.  

The Hückbach equation is a semi-ideal equation that is used to estimate the fluracity limits of a mixture by averaging the flflenenes of the individual components.  

For **H₂**:  
\[
