   \]

2. **Calculate the area of each paving slice**:  
   \[
   \text{Area of each piece} = \frac{\text{Total area}}{\text{Number of pins}} = \frac{812.5}{165} = 4.94 \text{ m}^2
   \]

3. **Calculate the width of each paving slice**:  
   \[
   \text{Width} = \frac{\text{Area of each piece}}{\text{Length of each piece}} = \frac{4.94}{2.25} = 2.18 \text{ m}
   \]

