\]
To solve for \( x \), we first simplify the numerator:
\[
x = \frac{3}{15}x + \frac{20}{30}x + 14
\]
Combine the fractions:
\[
x = \left( \frac{3}{15} + \frac{20}{30} \right)x + 14
