   \Delta S_{\text{gas}} = - \frac{Q_{\text{latent}}}{T_{\text{gas}}}} = - \frac{m_{\text{gas}} \cdot c_{\text{gas}} \cdot \Delta T_{\text{gas}}}{T_{\text{gas}}}
   \]
