   0.56 = 1 - \frac{1}{r^{0.45}}
   \]
   \[
   0.44 = \frac{1}{r^{0.45}}
   \]
   \[
   r^{0.45} = \frac{1}{0.44} \approx 2.28
   \]
   \[
